<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>纽约时报 &amp;gt; 美国 &amp;gt; 政治</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/spotlight/on-politics</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 20:20:46 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>更多特朗普选择的候选人在共和党初选中失利</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/19/us/politics/trump-primary-election-republican-endorsements.html</link><description>最近的一系列失利削弱了总统的获胜记录，引发了人们对他对党选民的控制力的新质疑。</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 20:20:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/19/us/politics/trump-primary-election-republican-endorsements.html</guid></item><item><title>佛罗里达州取代拜伦·唐纳德的竞选以已经竞选国会议员的候选人为特色</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/17/us/politics/florida-byron-donalds-election.html</link><description>我们来看看拜伦·唐纳德的替代者竞争激烈。</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:48:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/17/us/politics/florida-byron-donalds-election.html</guid></item><item><title>参议员埃德·马基的进步政治能否帮助他克服年龄问题？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/14/us/politics/ed-markey-senator-age.html</link><description>埃德·马基希望他的进步政治能够拯救他在马萨诸塞州。</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 23:08:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/14/us/politics/ed-markey-senator-age.html</guid></item><item><title>进步派惨遭失败后，民主党面临的三个问题</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/12/us/politics/david-crowley-francesca-hong-democrats-wisconsin.html</link><description>关键战场上的民主党选民正表现出激烈的分裂。从现在到 2028 年，该党有很多事情需要讨论。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 18:36:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/12/us/politics/david-crowley-francesca-hong-democrats-wisconsin.html</guid></item><item><title>威斯康星州州长民主党初选的过山车般的结束</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/10/us/politics/francesca-hong-wisconsin-democratic-primary.html</link><description>民主党似乎有可能提名一位民主社会主义者担任州长。他们是怎么来到这里的？</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 21:44:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/10/us/politics/francesca-hong-wisconsin-democratic-primary.html</guid></item><item><title>他们是久经考验的民主党人。选民关心吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/07/us/politics/angie-craig-haley-stevens-democrats.html</link><description>2018 年，海莉·史蒂文斯 (Haley Stevens) 和安吉·克雷格 (Angie Craig) 受到民主党人的赞扬。今年，他们面临着艰难的初选。</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 22:29:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/07/us/politics/angie-craig-haley-stevens-democrats.html</guid></item><item><title>阿卜杜勒·赛义德能否在大选前团结密歇根州民主党人？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/el-sayed-michigan-skeptical-voters.html</link><description>他的微弱优势可能预示着未来的挑战。</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 17:35:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/el-sayed-michigan-skeptical-voters.html</guid></item><item><title>密歇根州民主党参议院初选已成为该党夏季最丑陋的竞选</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/michigan-democratic-senate-primary-race-ideology.html</link><description>民主党参议院初选将使保守派与崛起的联盟展开对决。</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 21:10:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/michigan-democratic-senate-primary-race-ideology.html</guid></item><item><title>中期选举升温，民主党人担心什么</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/democrats-primary-elections-midterms.html</link><description>民主党有很多事情进展顺利。这就是可能出错的地方。</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 22:02:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/democrats-primary-elections-midterms.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普在任期间赚了数十亿美元。他的政党会付出政治代价吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/29/us/politics/trump-personal-wealth.html</link><description>总统去年在任期间的收入达到惊人的 22 亿美元。民主党人希望将其作为中期选举的竞选议题。</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 22:03:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/29/us/politics/trump-personal-wealth.html</guid></item></channel></rss>